izedLoanFeeCost" sign="-" scale="3" id="Tc_fJYXiSQr4ke9dWAB-ohTLA_16_6">1,055</ix:nonFraction>)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:70.14%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.08%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.25%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.11%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_-yvQzg-CV0yh_wrIFa0_7g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestAfterAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="3" id="Tc_2MmrV3o5Okq33eT9JgCFEw_17_3">282,289</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.08%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;">$</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.83%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_OZPY_o6nckS7uCXf_-4gjQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestAfterAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="3" id="Tc_l7Bo3Hl2O06-P7y3ZUe9sw_17_6">267,949</ix:nonFraction></span></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;background:#ffff00;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_us-gaap_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_us-gaap_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_us-gaap_CommercialRealEstateMember_xzs-dxGdQUSR0G2_K8lXig" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PrincipalAmountOutstandingOnLoansSecuritized" scale="6" id="Narr_ah5AzPT29UqUg9oMTH3PHw">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million of loans sold related to the commercial real estate segment while $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_us-gaap_ResidentialPortfolioSegmentMember_us-gaap_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_us-gaap_ResidentialRealEstateMember_hrSwmbSI60egyEDUo3T5Wg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PrincipalAmountOutstandingOnLoansSecuritized" scale="0" id="Narr_gldDlc4R3UeILzZ-7WZqWw">853,000</ix:nonFraction> related to the one to four residential segment. As of December 31, 2025, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_us-gaap_CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_us-gaap_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_us-gaap_CommercialRealEstateMember_Y0LHoJ4Xz0GgV5oiDkJV5g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PrincipalAmountOutstandingOnLoansSecuritized" scale="6" id="Narr_dOAkd6kl7UGmnzN73Rql9w">3.5</ix:nonFraction> million of loans sold related to the commercial real estate segment while $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis_us-gaap_ResidentialPortfolioSegmentMember_us-gaap_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis_us-gaap_ResidentialRealEstateMember__lw250pt6UuYvCNACL5uuA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PrincipalAmountOutstandingOnLoansSecuritized" scale="0" id="Narr_sbsOZpyygkCVYBOzYWL-Cw">886,000</ix:nonFraction> related to the one to four residential segment. The loan balances used in the credit quality disclosures included in this footnote are presented gross, without reducing the balance for portions sold. All sold loans are current on payments, accruing and pass rated, and are disclosed as such within the one to four residential and commercial real estate segments in the respective subsequent table disclosures.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Accrued interest on loans totaling approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_-yvQzg-CV0yh_wrIFa0_7g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAccruedInterestAfterAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="6" id="Narr_6bHfFPTjLE-7rp8OvFm3tA">1.3</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_OZPY_o6nckS7uCXf_-4gjQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAccruedInterestAfterAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="6" id="Narr_JB6E_N9SD06t39YvIHw44Q">1.0</ix:nonFraction> million at June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025 respectively, was excluded from the amortized cost basis of loans.</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_hu4aKIDnDEWp9X0JT67BDA" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForCreditLossesOnFinancingReceivablesTableTextBlock" id="Tb_P5a2pV58l0GSn9cSen1tdg" continuedAt="Tb_P5a2pV58l0GSn9cSen1tdg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">13</p></div></div>
