ap;width:1.44%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.71%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_-yvQzg-CV0yh_wrIFa0_7g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" scale="3" id="Tc_xVBOaX05Ok2sN-yQv5ruRg_9_3">7,337</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.27%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.55%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;">$</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.68%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="color:#231f20;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_OZPY_o6nckS7uCXf_-4gjQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" scale="3" id="Tc_Zfb8k56MjUeZY6g3FL6aLA_9_6">7,420</ix:nonFraction></span></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;background:#ffff00;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Bank leases a building for one of its branches. The Bank does not have any future lease commitments for that facility, and is operating on a&#160;month-to-month basis. Rent expense was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_BranchLeaseMonthToMonthMember_p669iINdpkmh-qQ4zGk5GA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_GIlG79PzA0G7gTyHNc6-Og">20,400</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_BranchLeaseMonthToMonthMember_o526rvc9MEaiQp3Mnz-PpA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_DoHq-Y9IGE-mArUBS5P4Ug">40,800</ix:nonFraction> during the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, respectively. Rent expense was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_BranchLeaseMonthToMonthMember_YVup7SHXYUG07q4tRNV3pQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_m3xywBerP0OSlQN9knA_tA">20,400</ix:nonFraction><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">  and </span>$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_BranchLeaseMonthToMonthMember_ZifqrF2JO0CA6rkmCqW-pA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_fs_XS2f5PkyFx8Q-vnD2Tg">40,800</ix:nonFraction> during the three and six months ended June 30, 2025, respectively. The Bank also leases its Oak Park office. The <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_n9NhDjFEZEaqoO2-BAagHw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three&#160;year</span></span> lease was effective in January&#160;of 2023 and expired on December 31, 2025, and the Bank did not include renewal option periods in the original right of use asset as the renewal option was not determined to be reasonably certain to occur at lease inception. The lease was renewed in January of 2026. The right of use asset and lease liability are $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_OakParkOfficeLeaseMember_fFf__SyYeE2s-0HvqoRVGg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseRightOfUseAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_m4b0TUS7W0Ow6x3qeWjtow">337,661</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_OakParkOfficeLeaseMember_fFf__SyYeE2s-0HvqoRVGg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseLiability" scale="0" id="Narr_7mrNVR3BmEWLSVbqaCaZ4g">339,174</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, as of June 30, 2026, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_OakParkOfficeLeaseMember_M7AeWUbAR06wKfqaGYKsgg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseLiability" scale="0" id="Narr_FNWT1JyXLUS_J9kfj7Sr2Q"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_OakParkOfficeLeaseMember_M7AeWUbAR06wKfqaGYKsgg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseRightOfUseAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_m6qTbiD-xEm3oeg2GZMf8g">0</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> as of December&#160;31, 2025. The right of use asset is included in other assets on the consolidated balance sheet and the lease liability is included in accounts payable and accrued expenses on the consolidated balance sheet. There are <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_Htska1gISEqm2PR1gKkgog;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">four years and six months</span></span> remaining on the lease, all payments will be made by 2030. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_hu4aKIDnDEWp9X0JT67BDA" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock" id="Group_2eujQeolG0-6u2IHPS2yyQ" continuedAt="Group_2eujQeolG0-6u2IHPS2yyQ_2" escape="true">The payments remaining on the lease consist of the following for the periods presented:</ix:nonNumeric></p><ix:continuation id="Group_2eujQeolG0-6u2IHPS2yyQ_2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.04%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.65%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:botto