dth:1.95%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.34%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="color:#231f20;font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LeaseContractualTermAxis_hyne_OakParkOfficeLeaseMember_fFf__SyYeE2s-0HvqoRVGg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityPaymentsDue" scale="0" id="Tc_2j-iGYbOEUKiEIl5VKGbMA_8_3">369,000</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_hu4aKIDnDEWp9X0JT67BDA" name="us-gaap:IntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_kcu017It4kK5t-6LkMBkew" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">7.</b></span>Core Deposit Intangibles</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The core deposit intangibles (&#8220;CDI&#8221;) were acquired in business combinations. On October&#160;16, 2020, the Bank acquired Loomis Federal Savings and Loan Association, which included a CDI of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2020_To_10_16_2020_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_hyne_LoomisFederalSavingsAndLoanAssociationMember_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_CoreDepositsMember_5K873ju0gkWYYxniVukQTA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinitelivedIntangibleAssetsAcquired1" scale="0" id="Narr_OcNkP5p_6UiL0xVOe9Np0Q">3,000</ix:nonFraction>. The Bank has an additional CDI of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2017_To_12_31_2017_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialBusinessAcquisitionsMember_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_CoreDepositsMember_aBEQgYac7EWPj3mvxoTdsQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinitelivedIntangibleAssetsAcquired1" scale="0" id="Narr__0fNqo28qkquQ-VdHEuiRA">2,705,000</ix:nonFraction> from a previous business combination that is being amortized over its estimated useful life of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2017_To_12_31_2017_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialBusinessAcquisitionsMember_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_CoreDepositsMember_aBEQgYac7EWPj3mvxoTdsQ" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife" id="Narr_1oJxj8k9f0aRL_zD62JUFg">120</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;months. Accumulated amortization at June 30, 2026 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_CoreDepositsMember_cLz1IpqXkUaLUXRhN5IsLw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsAccumulatedAmortization" scale="6" id="Narr_YrQ3E1KTeEWsBomphSRWog">2.6</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_CoreDepositsMember_c-8S3zelkkiynlzeQZLc-g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsAccumulatedAmortization" scale="6" id="Narr_9AgVQ-b930iho-pWnh12vw">2.5</ix:nonFraction> million at December&#160;31, 2025. The CDIs are reviewed for impairment when events or circumstances indicate that the carrying amount may not be recoverable. No events or circumstances indicating impairment existed as of June 30, 2026 and December&#160;31, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">CDI, net of accumulated amortization, at June 30, 2026 is approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DYxuJxWTOEmd_sKITldJgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_-yvQzg-CV0yh_wrIFa0_7g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsNet" scale="0" id="Narr_8w096-w7pEmEDqnA64pb0Q">46,000</ix:nonFraction>. The entire remaining balance is expected to amortize before the end of 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">18</p></div></div>
